{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30589","headline":"和主司王起 · 崔轩","name":"和主司王起","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"满朝朱紫半门生，新榜劳人又得名。\n国器旧知收片玉，朝宗转觉集登瀛。\n同升翰苑三年美，继入花源九族荣。\n共仰莲峰听雪唱，欲赓仙曲意怔营。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔轩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30589.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30589","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}